# Local-only Claude Code credentials (official Anthropic / pure Claude).
# Copy to `.env.claude` only if you prefer a file over host env / `claude` login.
#
#   cp .env.claude.example .env.claude
#
# Preferred auth:
#   1) Run `claude` and complete Anthropic sign-in, OR
#   2) Export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the host (forwarded via remoteEnv)
#
# Do not set ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL — that is only for third-party providers.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
